WEBVTT

NOTE
Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_07h.avi - Floating together toward Ragnarok
Duration: approximately 14 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:14.000
Squall and Rinoa float together in silence, his arms wrapped around her protectively. They drift slowly through space as a unit, her unconscious form cradled against him. Around them, fragments of debris from the destroyed Lunar Base tumble and rotate in their eternal, silent dance. The camera pulls back slowly, revealing more of the scene. In the distance, a massive red spaceship emerges from the darkness — the Ragnarok, a sleek and imposing Esthar spacecraft shaped like a soaring dragon. Its swept-back wings resemble a dragon's wings, and its hull is a deep crimson. Squall adjusts their trajectory, using precise thruster burns to orient their bodies toward the Ragnarok. The ship grows steadily larger as they approach it. Stars surrounding them mark the infinite expanse they traverse. The Ragnarok represents hope and salvation — a way home for both of them.
